pretty good English.

00:09:06.994 --> 00:09:10.138
So we weren't sure because no...

00:09:10.138 --> 00:09:13.342
I suppose, how should I say this?

00:09:13.342 --> 00:09:16.352
It's been difficult to
estimate, I suppose,

00:09:16.352 --> 00:09:18.596
how well in English, English group of--

00:09:18.596 --> 00:09:19.429
