00:09:20.277 --> 00:09:21.752
An English group of VTubers

00:09:21.752 --> 00:09:23.389
would appeal to an
English speaking audience

00:09:23.389 --> 00:09:25.930
because those who came before
us have done well of course.

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:29.647
But it's hard to tell
because we're the first,

00:09:29.647 --> 00:09:32.095
mainly English speaking, right?

00:09:32.095 --> 00:09:34.177
So we basically had no idea

00:09:34.177 --> 00:09:36.339
