kind of interesting."

00:14:51.155 --> 00:14:52.914
And then you watch some and you're like,

00:14:52.914 --> 00:14:56.186
"Huh, that VTuber kinda clicks," you know?

00:14:56.186 --> 00:14:57.440
- Like, "Oh, that clip was interesting.

00:14:57.440 --> 00:15:00.193
