your debut stream again?

00:15:39.979 --> 00:15:43.680
- I think that the peak
number of viewers was 60,000.

00:15:43.680 --> 00:15:45.137
- Jesus Christ!

00:15:45.137 --> 00:15:45.970
- Holy shit!

00:15:45.970 --> 00:15:47.900
- How'd you go from zero to 60 K.

00:15:47.900 --> 00:15:48.733
- Yeah.

00:15:48.733 --> 00:15:49.566
- In a day.

00:15:49.566 --> 00:15:52.109
- I mean I've, I think we
all had like kind of...

00:15:52.109 --> 00:15:52.942
- I don't think...

00:15:52.942 --> 00:15:55.864
We've never reached those
numbers in live streaming terms.

00:15:55.864 --> 00:15:58.137
- Right, I mean, I've had like
livestreams that were big,

00:15:58.137 --> 00:16:00.010
but nothing like that and
especially not in my first time.

00:16:00.010 --> 00:16:02.518
Is it kind of overwhelming
to have to jump into this

00:16:02.518 --> 00:16:04.918
and start off with such a big amount?

00:16:04.918 --> 00:16:07.496
'Cause like I said, we've
all had really gradual rises

00:16:07.496 --> 00:16:09.014
over the years.

00:16:09.014 --> 00:16:11.595
Is it daunting, even as a death god?

00:16:11.595 --> 00:16:14.058
- Right, well, see, here's
the thing when your death,

00:16:14.058 --> 00:16:16.337
no one really sees you, right?

00:16:16.337 --> 00:16:18.538
I mean, for the most
part, maybe you do see me,

00:16:18.538 --> 00:16:19.371
but not as I am now.

00:16:19.371 --> 00:16:20.613
- I think there's people you kill and doom

00:16:20.613 --> 00:16:22.003
see it coming for...

00:16:22.003 --> 00:16:22.836
(laughs)

00:16:22.836 --> 00:16:23.669
- Well I would hope so.

00:16:23.669 --> 00:16:24.502
- Oh they're the purgers.

00:16:24.502 --> 00:16:26.293
- Oh there it is, there's
the guy, he's gonna kill us.

00:16:26.293 --> 00:16:27.677
(laughs)

00:16:27.677 --> 00:16:28.510
- Exactly.

00:16:28.510 --> 00:16:30.501
Well, I mean, if you
think about it that way,

00:16:30.501 --> 00:16:33.198
