00:17:08.297 --> 00:17:09.130
- That is the internet yeah.

00:17:09.130 --> 00:17:10.116
- It's really pretty good at that.

00:17:10.116 --> 00:17:12.836
- And as death, I'm prepared for that.

00:17:12.836 --> 00:17:13.755
