they might've been like,

01:13:13.631 --> 01:13:14.464
at least in Japan,

01:13:14.464 --> 01:13:16.216
there might've been
like a prior hype to it

01:13:16.216 --> 01:13:18.639
because it was written by the
same guy who did Eyeshield 21?

01:13:18.639 --> 01:13:19.794
- Right.

01:13:19.794 --> 01:13:20.851
- People were like, "Oh shit!

01:13:20.851 --> 01:13:22.480
"This is the guy who wrote Eyeshield 21.

01:13:22.480 --> 01:13:24.454
"So it must be just as
good as Eyeshield 21."

01:13:24.454 --> 01:13:26.185
And then you watch it and yore like...

01:13:26.185 --> 01:13:28.600
