from your debut stream,

01:13:32.214 --> 01:13:33.575
you said you really
liked Madoka Magicaright?

01:13:33.575 --> 01:13:34.611
- Yes
- Really?

01:13:34.611 --> 01:13:35.693
- [Connor] Oh wow.

01:13:35.693 --> 01:13:37.258
