show of all times is...

01:13:52.793 --> 01:13:54.308
It has to be Gurren Lagann.

01:13:54.308 --> 01:13:56.255
- Oh wow.
- Yes.

01:13:56.255 --> 01:13:57.231
- Good taste.

01:13:57.231 --> 01:13:58.898
- That is a classic.

01:14:00.049 --> 01:14:01.989
- It was one of my first actually anime

01:14:01.989 --> 01:14:04.252
that I really watched and loved.

01:14:04.252 --> 01:14:06.913
- Was that like the anime that
you'd say got you into anime?

01:14:06.913 --> 01:14:07.746
- Yes, I would say.

01:14:07.746 --> 01:14:09.659
Well, because I had
watched a couple before

01:14:09.659 --> 01:14:12.367
that my friends in Rieber
school had recommended to me.

01:14:12.367 --> 01:14:14.805
For example, like I watched,

01:14:14.805 --> 01:14:16.921
