01:14:28.676 --> 01:14:29.509
And I was like,

01:14:29.509 --> 01:14:32.174
"This made me feel something
that I didn't feel before.

01:14:32.174 --> 01:14:33.799
"That's crazy, I love it.

01:14:33.799 --> 01:14:35.074
"And maybe animate is like this.

01:14:35.074 --> 01:14:37.185
"Cool, awesome, I'll keep watching it."

01:14:37.185 --> 01:14:38.018
And still to this day

01:14:38.018 --> 01:14:38.851
though I haven't found.
- But unfortunately

01:14:38.851 --> 01:14:41.887
we wouldn't see anything like
that for a very long time.

01:14:41.887 --> 01:14:42.720
- Exactly

01:14:44.134 --> 01:14:45.429
- Yeah. I just checked.

01:14:45.429 --> 01:14:49.267
Madoka Magica is 2011. So
I'd say almost 10 years.

01:14:49.267 --> 01:14:51.168
Almost 10 years at this
point, which is fucking--

01:14:51.168 --> 01:14:52.001
- Fuck!

01:14:52.001 --> 01:14:54.130
